  "slack.decide.in-product": "Nothing was recorded. This one can only be decided on its page in {brand}: {url}",
  "slack.decide.not-found": "Nothing was recorded. {brand} cannot find this proposal in your company.",
  // 2026-09-28 escalation bundle, English only: what the checks FOUND, by the reason that decided the suggestion.
