  "console.memory.import.prompt.lead.openclaw": "Use what this OpenClaw workspace holds: your memory files, the agents and skills it has configured, the routines it runs on a schedule, and the decisions recorded in past sessions. Create a portable Company Context Export from it.",
  "console.memory.import.prompt.lead.other": "Use everything you hold about this company: your saved memory, files, projects and this conversation. Create a portable Company Context Export from it.",
  "console.memory.import.prompt.rules": "Extract only durable information that would help understand the company later. Include: company facts, product facts, customer facts, market facts; important decisions and why they were made; operating preferences and recurring ways of working; the people involved and their roles. Leave out passwords, keys, payment details, health details and other sensitive personal information, one-off tasks, and anything you are not sure is true. Do not invent anything.\n\nWrite the export in exactly the format below so it can be read automatically. Keep every section name exactly as written, in English, even if you write the facts in another language. Leave out a section you have nothing for. Write one fact per line: a dash, a short topic of one to four words, a colon, then the fact as one complete sentence of at most 300 characters.\n\n{format}\n\nReturn only the export as plain text, with nothing before or after it.",
