  "studio.compiled.no.body": "Saved, but it does not compile, so it cannot be published. Say what to fix.",
  // The pictures a build asked for and did not get, 2026-10-05 (docs/plan/45, studio follow-ups). English only,
  // listed in TRANSLATION_DEFERRED under the same date. {missing} and {asked} are numbers shown as values beside a
