  "integrations.ok.tool-server-registered": "Registered {label}. Its tools are listed below with what the policy says about each; none reaches a model until the gate allows it.",
  "integrations.error.tool-server-name-taken": "A server with that short name is already registered. Remove it first, or choose another name.",
  "integrations.error.tool-server-bad-name": "The short name becomes part of a capability: lower-case letters, digits, hyphens and underscores only, up to 64 characters.",
  "integrations.error.tool-server-bad-label": "The label is what you call it on screen: one to 120 characters.",
