  "integrations.connection.kind.token": "Connected with a personal access token.",
  "integrations.connection.kind.githubApp": "Through the GitHub App on {account}. Each pull request uses a one-hour token for one repository.",
  // 2026-10-11: a refused connection is said where it is, the GitHub App can replace a pasted token in one press,
