  "announcement.proof.unknown": "The check could not reach your domain just now. Try again in a minute.",
  "announcement.proof.proven": "{host} is proven. You can agree to the post now.",
  "announcement.proof.noSite": "Your company has no website on record, so there is nothing to prove. Add one in the company settings first.",
